        "lede": "Virtual staging is a digital marketing technique for real estate listings: an interior designer adds photorealistic 3D furniture and decor to photos of empty or cleared rooms so buyers can visualize how the space lives, with no physical furniture ever entering the home. Bella's designers stage Montreal listings — from Plateau walk-ups to Griffintown condos — in 24 to 48 hours, from {price:virtual-staging} a photo.",
